Subject: [PATCH] Tracker: Past SLA delta and 14-day spark from live data

breachTrend (lib/analytics.js) recomputes breaches as of a week ago and for each of the last 14 days, using the same rules as the live count. Issues closed since a past time are counted as open then (from updated_at). Tracker KPI shows change vs last week and the spark. Tests 111/111.
